      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is caused by the secure instances, and more recently in the past couple days, the API request to reserve a slot in the room.\n\nI imagine this can't be fixed, but it would be nice to have visual feedback, especially since Portal Prompt is confusing with HUD off (separate canny)",
