  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-07-30T22:23:41.114Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With portal prompts, there's a noticeable lag between when I pull the trigger and when the fade to black begins. This can make it a bit confusing as to whether I successfully entered the portal or not. It would be good to start the fade out immediately, even if there's additional processing needed before the prior world can be unloaded.",
